  <item>
    <title>春曦来了|05 育儿，育己：妈妈与孩子共同成长的秘密</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/675cd93e7d8426f692f56038</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">675cd93e7d8426f692f56038</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 14 Dec 2024 01:12:14 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>久违啦~</span></p><span></span><p><span>春曦来了~</span></p><span></span><p><span>这次，我和曦分享了我们各自的育儿观。</span></p><span></span><p><span>我们俩在我刚生完澹澹的第一年一起去上了正面管教，后来又前后脚去上了陈忻老师的《从心理解孩子》的课程，现在也一起在学习心理学。</span></p><span></span><p><span>在育儿育己的路上，我们一直都是彼此最珍贵的同伴。</span></p><span></span><p><span>欢迎你来听我们俩唠嗑。</span></p><span></span><p><span>show notes</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="126">00:02:06</a>:深入探讨育儿课程的价值：发展心理学与精神分析的关联</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="249">00:04:09</a>:不同心理学流派的育儿观：人的发展阶段与需求</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="372">00:06:12</a>:孩子的终极目标：培养独立、自信、快乐的个体</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="558">00:09:18</a>:育儿观：找到自己的月光，建立亲密而有距离的关系</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="745">00:12:25</a>:育儿观与个人成长：预期与实际的交叉螺旋</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="931">00:15:31</a>:建立稳定的关系基础：家长与孩子之间的关键互动</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1116">00:18:36</a>:寻找那束温柔的目光：重要的是安全感和认可</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1303">00:21:43</a>:家长的育儿观念：如何营造宽松友爱的家庭环境？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1489">00:24:49</a>:创建宽松有爱的家庭氛围，育儿观念的转变与实践</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1675">00:27:55</a>:尊重差异，培养独立意识——探索有外宽松的家庭教育方式</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1862">00:31:02</a>:如何在坚定立场与关注孩子感受之间找到平衡？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2047">00:34:07</a>:育儿路上的商量与调整：孩子意见与大人责任的平衡之道</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/ltbjD1pL9-6FEKxr51Ftc-Cg62dH.m4a" length="54317809" type="audio/mp4"/>
